    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061209.0340\n\nDOHA, Dec 9 , 2006, 2006\n\nMalaysia's Koo and Tan win gold in doubles badminton\n\n\n\n\nMalaysia's Koo Kien Keat and Tan Boon Heong won Asian Games gold in the men's doubles badminton defeating Indonesia's Luluk Hadiyanto and Alvent Yulianto Chandra.\n\nThe Malaysian underdogs were in complete control against the fifth seeds winning 21-13, 21-14 in just 27 minutes.\n\nIndonesia's third seeds Markis Kido and Hendra Setiawan shared bronze with Jung Jae Sung and Lee Yong Dae, the second seeds from South Korea.",
